sequenceDiagram
  participant App as iPhone App
  participant Local as SQLite Local
  participant API as Ubuntu API
  participant State as State Service

  App->>API: /sync/bootstrap
  API->>State: read snapshot
  State->>API: snapshot + cursor
  API->>App: bootstrap payload
  App->>Local: upsert replica

  App->>Local: user creates message pending
  App->>API: /sync/push ops
  API->>State: apply ops
  State->>API: server seq
  API->>App: ack
  App->>Local: mark synced

  API-->>App: websocket task.status
  App->>Local: update replica
